WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.332 --> 00:00:03.320
(soft jazz music)

00:00:03.320 --> 00:00:05.930
- If someone does a lame
joke, I laugh too much.

00:00:05.930 --> 00:00:06.763
- Really?

00:00:06.763 --> 00:00:07.596
- Yeah.

00:00:07.596 --> 00:00:08.429
- You're a sweet guy.
- I don't wanna

00:00:08.429 --> 00:00:09.300
make them feel bad.

00:00:09.300 --> 00:00:10.950
- Oh, I wanna do just the opposite.

00:00:10.950 --> 00:00:12.450
I want them to feel horrible.

00:00:12.450 --> 00:00:13.353
- Wow.

00:00:13.353 --> 00:00:15.090
(Jerry laughing)

00:00:15.090 --> 00:00:17.100
- But doesn't it bother
you that they think

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:20.290
they're funny enough to make
a joke to make you laugh?

00:00:20.290 --> 00:00:21.930
- But why shouldn't they?

00:00:21.930 --> 00:00:25.100
- Because you've spent your
entire life in this craft,

00:00:25.100 --> 00:00:25.970
in this world.
- But you're treating it

00:00:25.970 --> 00:00:27.310
like an insult, and it's a compliment

00:00:27.310 --> 00:00:29.190
that they would love you
to laugh at them because

00:00:29.190 --> 00:00:30.550
they like you so much.
- Yes, because it would

00:00:30.550 --> 00:00:33.500
make them think that
they're on the same level,

00:00:33.500 --> 00:00:34.333
and they're not.

00:00:34.333 --> 00:00:36.300
- But it's not like someone
going up to a doctor

00:00:36.300 --> 00:00:37.960
and going, can I take your appendix out?

00:00:37.960 --> 00:00:38.793
- Yes, it is!

00:00:38.793 --> 00:00:39.634
- No, it's not!

00:00:39.634 --> 00:00:41.280
- It is to me!

00:00:41.280 --> 00:00:43.460
- We're not that important.

00:00:43.460 --> 00:00:44.390
- Aren't we?

00:00:44.390 --> 00:00:47.223
(Ricky cackling)

